1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,152
Welcome to Car Service Podcast!

2
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:04,494
Today we talk windshield repair.

3
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:06,932
Our guest had a chip fixed at Golden
Horse.

4
00:00:07,282 --> 00:00:08,818
Welcome, Pierre!

5
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:11,591
Thanks, happy to be here.

6
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:13,837
So Pierre, what brought you in?

7
00:00:14,187 --> 00:00:17,931
A stone hit my windshield on Sheikh Zayed
Road.

8
00:00:18,281 --> 00:00:20,105
A chip? How big?

9
00:00:20,455 --> 00:00:22,951
About a euro coin size.

10
00:00:23,301 --> 00:00:24,477
Did you book online?

11
00:00:24,827 --> 00:00:29,507
Yes, through golden-horse.ae, took two
minutes.

12
00:00:29,857 --> 00:00:31,825
How was the workshop when you arrived?

13
00:00:32,174 --> 00:00:37,214
Clean, organized, staff greeted me in
English and French.

14
00:00:37,564 --> 00:00:38,380
Nice touch.

15
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:41,970
They inspected the chip, said it was
repairable.

16
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,472
What did they do?

17
00:00:43,822 --> 00:00:47,686
Injected resin, cured with UV, polished.

18
00:00:48,036 --> 00:00:49,116
How long did it take?

19
00:00:49,466 --> 00:00:52,826
Under an hour, maybe 45 minutes.

20
00:00:53,176 --> 00:00:54,088
And the price?

21
00:00:54,437 --> 00:00:58,349
300 AED, exactly as quoted.

22
00:00:58,699 --> 00:00:59,731
No surprises?

23
00:01:00,081 --> 00:01:03,009
None, they explained every step.

24
00:01:03,359 --> 00:01:04,655
How does it look now?

25
00:01:05,005 --> 00:01:07,621
Invisible, clarity perfect.

26
00:01:07,971 --> 00:01:09,387
Feeling confident driving?

27
00:01:09,737 --> 00:01:12,353
Absolutely, peace of mind.

28
00:01:12,703 --> 00:01:13,831
Would you recommend?

29
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:17,540
Definitely, especially for luxury cars.

30
00:01:17,890 --> 00:01:20,602
Now Omar, tip for AC in Dubai summer?

31
00:01:20,952 --> 00:01:25,872
Run AC weekly, keep filter clean, book AC
diagnostic before peak heat.

32
00:01:26,222 --> 00:01:27,590
Simple but effective.

33
00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:29,212
Warning sign of the week:

34
00:01:29,562 --> 00:01:32,034
A tiny windshield chip can spread fast.

35
00:01:32,384 --> 00:01:34,160
Heat and vibration make it grow.

36
00:01:34,510 --> 00:01:37,486
Get it fixed early, saves a full
replacement.

37
00:01:37,835 --> 00:01:39,419
Thanks Pierre, thanks Omar.

38
00:01:39,769 --> 00:01:42,745
Book your windshield repair at
golden-horse.ae.

39
00:01:43,095 --> 00:01:45,375
See you next time on Car Service Podcast.
